#
# Max request body size (--web-max-body-bytes). A GraphQL POST whose body
# exceeds the cap is rejected with HTTP 413 by the Content-Length middleware,
# before the body is read. (The test harness starts this instance with
# --web-max-body-bytes 1024; the padding comment below pushes the body over it.)
#

POST {{url}}/graphql
```graphql
{ __typename }
# 
```
HTTP 413
